Need maybe expose `getShift` in window. Not needed.

Need start of shift maybe game already active from constructor. But UI constructor updateShiftHud uses active. Good. Need maybe after boot show toast "SHIFT 01 LIVE" maybe. Add after finishBoot? Not necessary. Could toast. We can add in boot after setView:
```
ui.toast('SHIFT 01 LIVE · clear priority briefs before they expire', 3600)
```
Good. Add before renderer loop maybe. But on boot screen, toast behind boot? Boot screen z? It might be hidden behind; after finishBoot scheduled 280ms. Toast at boot time might show while boot overlay still visible but eventually. Better setTimeout after finishBoot. Could add in the timeout. Hmm, not necessary; HUD visible with briefs.

Need pause behavior: The game shift is active even if paused, but update not called. HUD is-paused class via setPaused. Good.

Need shift end while a brief select etc. fine.

Potential issue: `ShiftGame` constructor calls `this.start()` before `this.listeners`? listeners set before start yes. UI not listening yet, but state visible in UI constructor from properties. Good.

Potential issue: When `start()` called after end, reset `lastBriefKey` maybe UI update key. It emits start, UI update, lastBriefKey may be '' and requests two -> render. Good.

Now CSS. Need add all. Place shift HUD after HUD bar styles maybe near line 390 before left rail. We'll append a block before left rail. And responsive overrides in existing media queries, plus shift dialog styles near help dialog. Also toast top adjust.

